WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.370
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:15.200
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.020
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:26.180
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:33.090
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:37.060
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:44.030
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:52.180
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:59.380
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:05.620
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:11.590
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:19.030
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:26.950
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.890
Well, go on in.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:01.280
I want you to return Hikaru.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.290
That would be a problem.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:46.360
I'm Nova.

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.330
The one who will kill you.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:54.390
Nova and Regalia,
Rune-God of the Devil

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.050
Hello, Hikaru.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.820
I'm Nova.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:15.180
The one who will kill you.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.890
Nova?

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.790
I've been wanting to meet you.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.990
After all, we've only been able
to talk in our dreams up till now.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:35.040
But finally, Mother said
I could come meet you, Hikaru.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.140
Mother?

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:40.440
Mother...

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.380
Mother Debonair.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.720
Hikaru...

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.880
Let's play!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.170
Why do we have to fight each other?

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:07.100
Because I love you, Hikaru!

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.350
Hikaru!

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.890
I love you!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.250
Nova! You came from Autozam?

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.760
Or Fahren? Chizeta?

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:34.460
None of them! I was
born here, right beside Cephiro!

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.000
I came here...

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.410
...to kill you, Hikaru!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.110
It's so cute how you scream.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.360
I love it!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:05:00.120
Let me hear more of
your cute voice, Hikaru!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.420
Flame...

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.290
Arrow!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.170
Flame Arrow!

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:29.990
The same magic that I use...

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.930
I can use any magic
that you can, Hikaru.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:35.620
Because...

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.090
...I am Hikaru.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.670
I'm the same as you.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.030
That's why...

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.450
...I asked Mother
to make me something nice.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.960
This is my Rune-God.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:17.230
Regalia.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.470
Rune-God...

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:23.070
Call my name.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.740
Rayearth?

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:29.010
Thine enemy is much more
powerful than thou believe.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.850
Call my name!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.520
Rayearth!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.750
Is that really a Rune-God?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.120
It comes!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.640
Look!

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.150
Rayearth?

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:41.660
Is that a Rune-God?

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:58.460
More!

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:01.330
Let's play some more, Hikaru!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.400
Winds of Protection!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.680
Flame Arrow!

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:19.590
Water Dragon!

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.170
Umi!

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.200
Fuu!

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:35.870
You interrupted my
playtime with Hikaru!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:43.640
You must be
the teammates that Hikaru loves.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.010
Good timing.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:48.060
I'll rip you to shreds
in front of Hikaru's eyes!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.370
This is...

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.500
An alternate dimension.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.840
Alternate dimension?

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.040
Alternate dimension?
Yes.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:10.200
This is Cephiro, but not Cephiro.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:14.670
This is not where
you Rune-Gods stay?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:20.290
It is not. This is not the alternate
dimension from whence we sleep.

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:22.760
It's a space that Nova created?

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:23.790
Yes.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.330
Nova? That girl's name is Nova?

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.000
What are you talking about?

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.030
Hikaru is mine.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.730
She can't be friendly to other girls!

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:41.810
W-Wait a minute!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.940
Why is Hikaru yours?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:48.080
Hikaru is mine!
She plays only with me!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:49.450
Flame...

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:51.380
...Arrow!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:02.020
Don't interrupt.
I'm going to kill those two.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:05.270
If you hurt Umi or Fuu...

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.730
...I'll never forgive you!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.200
Hikaru...

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.100
I love you, Hikaru.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:16.870
I only want to play with you, Hikaru...

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.570
Hikaru, I just...

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.110
I just want to kill you!

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:26.420
Another dimension?

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:27.460
Beware.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.820
The evil presence has grown.

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:32.520
W-What do you mean by beware?

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.140
Hey, why are
you guys running away?

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.310
I'm going to the trouble of killing you.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:51.970
I think people who are glad
to be killed are pretty rare!

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.450
Why?

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.810
You're all gonna die anyway.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.910
That has yet to be decided.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.610
Emerald Typhoon!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:05.720
This is an alternate
dimension she hath created.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:08.920
All thy powers of magic are halved.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.530
Windam...

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.120
I understand.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.700
You understand, right, Hikaru?

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.200
I told you...

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:20.370
If you hurt Umi or Fuu...
If you hurt my dear teammates...

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.810
...I will never forgive you!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.840
Soon Cephiro
will belong to my mother!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:33.010
Belong to your mother?
What do you mean?

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:40.320
Mother Debonair has been waiting for
the Pillar to disappear from Cephiro...

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:46.600
...and for everyone here to lose to the
uncertainty and fear in their own hearts!

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.870
Lose to their own hearts?

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.470
Umi!

00:11:57.810 --> 00:11:58.840
Here!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.810
Hikaru, play with me!

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:04.080
Look at me and only me!

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.310
Nova...

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.320
Something comes!

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.990
An enormous,
evil power approaches.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:46.620
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:52.590
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:09.310
The one in my dreams...

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.350
Yes.

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:13.890
I am the one who
appeared in your dreams.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:18.750
Impossible...
I just thought that, and yet...

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:19.830
Why?

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:26.560
To me, seeing into
someone's heart is trivial...

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:29.230
...girl from another world.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:34.510
The legendary Magic Knights
that are said to save Cephiro.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:39.480
My existence is wished for
by those in the land of Cephiro.

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:41.610
What did you say?

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:44.080
What do you mean?

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.680
The time of ruin is near.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:50.080
Everything in the land will die out...

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:56.020
...in a span of time as short
as grains of sand are small.

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:03.170
My wish is complete
annihilation, an absolute darkness.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:05.260
An elegant void.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:10.210
For that purpose,
the legend of the Magic Knights...

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.040
...is in the way!

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:14.670
My dear daughter Nova.

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:19.280
Don't you want to see
the red blood of the Magic Knights?

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:20.650
I want to!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.650
Especially...

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.720
...Hikaru's blood!

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.530
My dear Nova.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:39.370
Crush the legend of
the Magic Knights...

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:43.170
...that even the Pillar
of Cephiro couldn't.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.340
Yes, Mother.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.060
Wait!

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.890
I am right beside all of you.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:04.730
I will wait for your deaths from here.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:11.140
I will wait for everything in
this land, Cephiro, to die out.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:17.670
Hikaru, I love you.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:19.380
But...

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:23.380
Everything you love, Hikaru, I hate!

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.080
Hikaru!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.230
Ms. Hikaru!

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.460
Hey, that's enough!

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.660
Who's going to kill whom?

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:46.030
I cannot be killed
with a smile on my face!

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:52.910
Tell us. Who in
the world are you guys?

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.040
Why are you fighting us?

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.610
Winds of Admonishment!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:11.490
Where exactly are you?

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:18.860
Mother told you earlier.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.940
We're right beside this land, Cephiro.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:23.300
Right...

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.740
...beside us?

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:28.280
Don't you realize it? We're so close.

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.790
Stop!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.220
Hikaru...

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:49.130
Hikaru!

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:50.490
Ms. Hikaru!

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:54.830
Oh.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:59.000
Magic Knights'
swords break so easily.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:00.670
How boring.

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:04.340
Become stronger, Hikaru.
And play with me.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.440
I'll see you again, Magic Knights.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.510
But next time...

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.410
...I will kill you!

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:32.740
Ms. Hikaru... Hikaru...

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.820
What was that evil presence?

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:58.230
That evil presence that
seems to cover all of Cephiro...

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:11.900
Beside...

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:14.780
Right beside Cephiro...

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:16.980
No.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.950
I felt the presence
from Cephiro itself.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.850
The little lady has disappeared.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:26.090
Is that magic as well?

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:30.760
Hikaru is a cute girl.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:38.170
So it's true only those from another
world can become Magic Knights.

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:41.070
I thought I told you.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:45.410
Cephiro is a land that
cannot be without a Pillar.

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:48.110
I don't think it's right by any means.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:50.280
That's why I returned.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:20:00.060
I don't want to fight against you.

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:15.700
You okay, Eagle?

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:16.740
Eagle!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:20.670
Lantis...

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.370
I'm pretty sure he's
using protective magic.

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.900
Even if you shoot, you won't hit him.

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:57.010
Zazu, your favorite
little lady has gone home.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:01.450
I made new clothes for Hikaru too...

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:03.920
Eagle.

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:10.220
I was prepared for this...

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:14.860
But I can't do it when
Lantis looks at me like that...

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.000
I was about to change my mind.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:25.380
No matter what reason I give,
it's not fun to invade other countries.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:30.780
I'll give you all
my sweets, so cheer up.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.490
Including the ones in your room.

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:51.400
My sword...

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:53.110
...snapped.

00:21:53.780 --> 00:21:54.970
Hikaru...

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.340
Ms. Hikaru...

00:22:17.870 --> 00:22:23.300
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:31.210
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:38.210
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:42.720
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:45.490
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:50.590
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:54.330
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.740 --> 00:23:01.670
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.510
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:14.240
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:20.420
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:28.730
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:37.610
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:47.850
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.520 --> 00:23:50.890
After Nova snapped my sword...

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:55.330
...Umi, Fuu, and the others in
the castle cheered me up with a bath.

00:23:55.430 --> 00:23:58.960
But then, those from
a new country, Chizeta, appeared.

00:23:59.070 --> 00:24:03.270
However, I don't have a sword,
so I can't call for Rayearth.

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:05.000
What should I do?

00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:07.070
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:07.310 --> 00:24:09.340
Chizeta's Mobile Fortress
and a Powerless Hikaru.

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:10.910
Chizeta's Mobile Fortress
and a Powerless Hikaru
Chizeta's Mobile Fortress
and a Powerless Hikaru.

00:24:10.910 --> 00:24:13.350
Chizeta's Mobile Fortress
and a Powerless Hikaru
You have to watch it!

00:24:13.350 --> 00:24:20.280
Who is it today?

00:24:21.390 --> 00:24:23.250
Today, it's Primera!

00:24:23.360 --> 00:24:23.690
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.690 --> 00:24:26.530
Look forward to the next episode!
You have to watch the next episode!

00:24:26.530 --> 00:24:29.330
Look forward to the next episode!
